      "text" : "discord\n*discords, discording, discorded*\n\n1. n. 不和；不调和；嘈杂声\n2. vi. 不一致；刺耳\n3. n. (Discord)人名；(法)迪斯科尔\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ ˈdɪskɔːrd \/  美\/ ˈdɪskɔːrd \/\n2）\nn. 不一致，不和谐；纷争，冲突；（音乐）不协和音\nv. 不一致，不和谐\n3）disagreement or conflict between people or things\n4）When new insight reveals discord, it often leads to a re-evaluation of previous assumptions.",
