      "text" : "inaugurated\n*inaugurate*\n\n1. v. 开始；开幕（inaugurate的过去分词）；使正式就任\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ ɪˈnɔːɡjəreɪtɪd \/  美\/ ɪˈnɔːɡjəreɪtɪd \/\n2）\nadj.新就职的；新成立的；新开始的\nv.（inaugurate的过去分词）为……举行就职典礼；开创；开始\n3）having recently been formally installed in a position of authority, especially as part of a ceremony\n4）That night, and the next day the newly inaugurated President Jefferson began his term.",
