    {
      "color" : "2",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "4e47b58a9c4f5644",
      "text" : "partisan\n*partisans*\n\n1. n. 游击队；虔诚信徒；党羽\n2. adj. 党派的；效忠的；偏袒的；盲目推崇的\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ pɑːtɪˈzæn \/ 美\/ ˈpɑːrtɪzən \/\n2）n. 支持者，拥护者；游击队员 adj. 党派性的，有偏袒的\n3）a strong supporter of a party, cause, or person, especially one who shows blind or prejudiced allegiance\n4）Partisan politics often leads to gridlock as each side refuses to compromise.",
