    },
    {
      "color" : "4",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "a65c5271ea725f82",
      "text" : "render\n*rendered, renders, rendering*\n\n1. n. 打底；交纳；粉刷\n2. vt. 致使；提出；实施；着色；以…回报\n3. vi. 给予补偿\n4. n. (Render)人名；(英、德)伦德尔\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ ˈrɛndər \/  美\/ ˈrɛndər \/\n2）\nv.提供，给予；作出（判断、决定等）；使成为；翻译；表达，表现；渲染；递交，提交；支付，偿还；演出，演奏；熬制（脂肪）\nn.缴纳；渲染；抹灰底层\n3）to give or provide something, or to make a judgment or decision\n4）The initial problem of our ability to render a historical judgment about original intent or understanding remains.",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 3396,
      "y" : 2268
    },
    {
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "7efabf033872011e",
      "text" : "resort to\n\n1. na. 使用(武力)\n2. [网络] 诉诸于；求助于；采取",
