    {
      "color" : "4",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "bd9b238448fc0f49",
      "text" : "superseding\n*supersede, supersedings*\n\n1. v. 取代，接替( supersede的现在分词 )\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ ˌsuːpəˈsiːdɪŋ \/  美\/ ˌsuːpərˈsiːdɪŋ \/\n2）\nv.取代，替代；接替；使无效\n3）to take the place of something\/somebody, especially because it is old-fashioned or no longer valid\n4）The new system supersedes the previous one, making it obsolete.",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 3124,
      "y" : 2268
    },
    {
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "e4ac9c49db841119",
      "text" : "dig up\n\n1. na. 查出；找到；开垦(荒地等)；采掘(山芋等)\n2. [网络] 挖出；掘起；发现",
