      "x" : 2776,
      "y" : 1608
    },
    {
      "color" : "2",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "114fe1e1e7a5e6fb",
      "text" : "compliance\n*compliances*\n\n1. n. 顺从，服从；承诺\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ kəmˈplaɪəns \/  美\/ kəmˈplaɪəns \/\n2）\nn.遵从，服从；顺从，听话；合规，符合（规定、法律等）\n3）the act of obeying a law, rule, or request, or the state of being obedient\n4）Because the Court cannot coerce compliance with its decisions, its constitutional authority is supported by our culture’s tradition of respect.",
      "type" : "text",
