      "text" : "refrigerators\n*refrigerator*\n\n1. n. [制冷] 冰箱，[制冷] 冷藏室；[制冷] 冷冻库（refrigerator的复数）\n\n--- AI 释义 ---\n1）英\/ rɪˈfrɪdʒəreɪtəz \/  美\/ rɪˈfrɪdʒəreɪtərz \/\n2）n.冰箱（复数形式）\n3）A household or commercial appliance that uses insulation and mechanical cooling to preserve food and other perishable items by keeping them at a low temperature.\n4）Refrigerators have become a standard appliance in most modern kitchens.",
