    },
    {
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "5629ca5cb1a0e61a",
      "text" : "handshake agreements\n\n1）英\/ˈhændʃeɪk əˈɡriːmənts\/ 美\/ˈhændʃeɪk əˈɡriːmənts\/\n2）n.握手协议，口头协议（通常指双方通过握手达成的非正式、无书面形式的协议）\n3）informal agreements made between parties by shaking hands, often relying on trust rather than written contracts, and sometimes considered legally enforceable but difficult to prove.\n4）Many small businesses still operate based on handshake agreements, but this can lead to misunderstandings later.",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 1576,
      "y" : 2816
    },
    {
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "9b5271e0fbfaccf7",
      "text" : "strips away\n*strip away*\n\n1. un. 一块；剥去；一小块；剥去",
      "type" : "text",
