      "y" : 2684
    },
    {
      "color" : "2",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "7629a3491a7d7dd5",
      "text" : "is informed by\n*be informed by, are informed by*\n\n1）英\/ɪnˈfɔːmd baɪ\/  美\/ɪnˈfɔːrmd baɪ\/\n2）受……影响；基于……；以……为支撑\n3）to be based on or influenced by something, especially knowledge or scholarship\n4）The perspective of this book is informed by much of the best scholarship about the subject.",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 1304,
      "y" : 2156
    },
    {
      "color" : "2",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "746708ffff97efd5",
      "text" : "tomes\n*tome*\n\n1）英\/ toʊmz \/  美\/ toʊmz \/\n2）n.大部头的书，厚册（尤指学术或权威著作）\n3）a large, heavy, and often scholarly book\n4）He lifted one of the dust-covered, leather-bound tomes of precedents from the law library shelf.",
