      "y" : 2552
    },
    {
      "color" : "2",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "98b9144cbb65618d",
      "text" : "fattening foods\n\n1）英\/ ˈfætənɪŋ fuːdz \/  美\/ ˈfætənɪŋ fudz \/\n2）使人发胖的食物；高热量食物\n3）foods that are high in calories and likely to cause weight gain\n4）She asked about the portions of fattening foods in the meal.",
