      "y" : 2024
    },
    {
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "6c96006aa6bcb56c",
      "text" : "drunkenness\n\n1）英\/ˈdrʌŋkənnəs\/ 美\/ˈdrʌŋkənnəs\/\n2）n.醉酒，酗酒；沉醉\n3）the condition of being drunk, especially as a habitual state\n4）Common human failings such as fornication, drunkenness, and idleness were legally—and frequently—punished, and laws were enacted to suppress them.",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 1576,
      "y" : 2024
    },
    {
      "color" : "1",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "753bbc6bf976dbc2",
      "text" : "formulated\n*formulate*\n\n1）英\/ˈfɔːmjuleɪtɪd\/ 美\/ˈfɔːrmjuleɪtɪd\/\n2）\nv.制定，规划；确切地阐述；用公式表示\n3）to create, invent, or produce something carefully, using all the necessary information\n4）The colonists formulated the Mayflower Compact, a legal document that governed their settlement.",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 1304,
      "y" : 1892
    },
    {
      "color" : "1",
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "84295ece1326f39a",
      "text" : "hyperlexis\n\nHyperlexis（过度立法综合症）指法律体系因法规数量过剩、内容冗余复杂、相互冲突或更新过快，导致公众难以理解遵守、执法成本激增及法治效能下降的现象",
      "type" : "text",
      "width" : 260,
      "x" : 1576,
      "y" : 1892
    },
    {
      "height" : 120,
      "id" : "bc80f5ba1541895f",
      "text" : "loaves\n\n1）英\/ ləʊvz \/  美\/ loʊvz \/\n2）n.面包（复数），（尤指）长方形大块面包\n3）plural form of loaf; shaped portions of bread that are baked in a single piece\n4）closely regulated economic affairs, prescribing the size of loaves of bread",
